{"id":"n15782-1-7","stage":1,"title":"만두 · 饺子","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15782-1-7-1","ko":"오늘따라 만두가 먹고 싶네.","zh":"今天怎么突然想吃饺子了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘：今天；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68207","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"만두가","meaning":"饺子","explanation":"만두：饺子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"만두","audio":"/audio/7c1c382652b8d675007a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15782","senseId":"1","lemma":"만두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만두가","audio":"/audio/dc78926671de19e9eb79.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"싶네.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶네","audio":"/audio/bc4b6b0f8648793e828e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68207","definition":"在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"7c1c382652b8d675","term":"만두","zh":"饺子","audio":"/audio/7c1c382652b8d675007a.mp3","entryId":"15782","definition":"将和好的面团擀成薄片，放上剁碎的肉末或蔬菜等各种馅料后包起来的食物。","pronunciation":["만두"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{